        {
          "tag": "enttypd",
          "text": "3-band color TIF images of the Total Magnetic Intensity, Reduced to Pole, and Vertical Derivative magnetic datasets.\nTMI = total magnetic intensity anomaly\nRTP = reduced to pole magnetic anomaly\nVD1 = vertical derivative magnetic anomaly\nRTP-VD1 = vertical derivative of the RTP magnetic anomaly"
        },
